// HZM coop - ARMORY Showroom loadout screen. GENERATED by docs/tools/gen_armory_urc.py (called from gen_loadout.py): do not edit.
// Picker = 18 card positions fed by the cfg chains of gen_armory.py (unlocked first); hero + compare read the inspected gun.
